data: {"id": "a7113265c1d14e7d-thinking-parallel_evidence-653", "run_id": "a7113265c1d14e7d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Node `node2` 状态为 Ready，排除了节点失联的原因。\n\n## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n| 来源 | 关键事实 |\n|------|---------|\n| **Pod YAML** | `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-07T23:09:46Z`，距今已超 15 分钟；`metadata.finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]`（自定义 finalizer）；`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 0`；`phase: Running`；container `app` 状态为 `Error exitCode=137`（OOM-kill），`ready=False` |\n| **Pod Events** | 仅有一条 `Normal Killing` 事件（44m 前）；无 `FailedKillPod`、volume unmount/detach 错误 |\n| **Node node2** | 状态 `Ready`，kubelet 正常，排除了节点失联导致的 Terminating 停滞 |\n| **", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788825250183, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

